---
title: Secuencia de Control de Actuador — Usuario → Actuador → ACK
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant CE as Control Engine
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant FW as Firmware
    participant SSR as SSR Relay

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note right of U: Comando manual
        U->>FE: Click "Actuator ON"
        FE->>API: PATCH /api/v1/devices/:id/actuators/:ch<br/>{state: "ON"}
        API->>API: authenticate (JWT) + authorize (RBAC)
        API->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/actuators<br/>{cmdId, channel, state, mode}
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: Ejecución en firmware
        MQTT->>FW: message on mush2/{id}/actuators
        FW->>FW: parse payload, validate cmdId
        FW->>SSR: digitalWrite(SSR_CH1, LOW) [active-LOW]
        SSR-->>FW: OK
        FW->>FW: NVS persist state
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note right of FW: Confirmación ACK
        FW->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/ack<br/>{cmdId, status: "OK", ts}
        MQTT->>API: onMessage ack
        API->>API: INSERT INTO events (type=ack)
        API->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/status<br/>{actuatorState, lifecycle: RUNNING}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of FE: Actualización UI
        API->>FE: SSE event: actuator<br/>{deviceId, actuatorId, state: "ON"}
        FE->>FE: Actualiza ActuatorControl badge
        U->>FE: Ve checkmark de confirmación
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of CE: Control automático (ADR-021)
        CE->>CE: evaluate() cada 8s
        CE->>CE: Compara telemetría vs setpoints
        alt Fuera de rango
            CE->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/actuators<br/>{cmdId, channel, state: "ON"}
            MQTT->>FW: command
            FW->>SSR: execute
            FW->>MQTT: publish ack
        end
    end
